                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">一、指导思想</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">通过举办本届艺术节，展现我校素质教育的特质和我校素质教育的成果，深化教育教学改革，进一步丰富学生课外艺术活动的形式和内容，使学校艺术教育工作在全面推进素质教育的进程中科学、健康、持续、快速发展。面向全体学生，立足于提高审美修养和人文素养，促进德智体美劳全面发展，展现学生朝气蓬勃、昂扬向上的精神风貌。营造健康高雅的校园文化环境，体现向真、向善、向美、向上的校园文化特质。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二、活动主题与内容</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">艺术节主题</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">艺彩飞扬，青春绽放</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">”。高一、高二各班围绕艺术节的主题，开展丰富多彩的适合学生个性发展，展示艺术才华的艺术活动，结合爱国、爱校、爱家、爱学习、爱生活，创作一批具有浓郁民族特色，表现广大中学生情趣的作品。作品要求做到思想性和艺术性的统一，具有创新性，体现时代特征、校园特色、学生特点。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">三、主要活动安排</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（一）绍兴一中</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教育集团</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">202</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校园文化艺术节开幕式（暨校园十佳歌手比赛）。</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">校园十佳歌手比赛以学生个人自愿报名为主，原则上各班不超过一个学生，并经过初选入围决赛。报名截止时间：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">11月2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">7</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">日中午。报名表在公共文件夹里，自行下载，填写好后写上班级放回公共文件夹。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">初赛不再组织现场评比，要求各</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">位选手</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">交</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">演唱</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">视频，</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">截止时间</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">12月1日。（具体要求：有伴奏的</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">演唱歌曲一段，使用一个固定机位正面全景录制，声音和图像必须同期录制。）<span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">节目视频上传到公共文件夹/德育处/202</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">5</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0px; text-wrap-mode: wrap; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">年校园艺术节/十佳</span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">决赛时间：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">暂定</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">6</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日下午</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">30</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">正式开始。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">  </span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">绍兴一中</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教育集团</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">202</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校园文化艺术节活动要求</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1、本次活动设歌唱与器乐、民族民间舞蹈、现代舞蹈、课本剧小品曲艺等四个板块，各班</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">自主选择其中的一个版块编排一个节目参加，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">鼓励跨班合作，表演人数不得少于</span><span style="font-family:宋体">8人（相声除外）。课本剧、舞台剧、小品要求录音，服装、道具自行准备，时间严格控制在</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8分钟</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">之内。器乐、舞蹈、歌曲等节目要求现场表演，不允许录音，时间控制在</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5分钟</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">之内。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2、比赛设初赛和决赛，</span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">初赛不再组织现场评比，要求各班递交完整的节目视频，</span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">要求各班在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">11</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">之前把节目视频上传到公共文件夹</span><span style="font-family:宋体">/德育处/202</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校园艺术节。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3、闭幕式暨迎新春文艺会演</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">时间：暂定</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">12月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">20</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">分高一、高二两场进行（具体时间另行通知）</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">地点：图书馆三楼报告厅一。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">三</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）绘画比赛：单体实物超写实写生</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.比赛形式：现场写生；</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.报名条件：有一定美术基础的学生；（报名时注明班级、姓名信息，以备后续班级加分）</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3.8开铅画纸学校提供，画具自备；</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">4.绘画时间2小时；</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">比赛时间</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12月1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日（周四下午</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3点-5点）</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5.报名形式：学校公共文件夹\音美劳\2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校艺术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">美术</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">\绘画现场比赛文件夹（自行下载相关内容报名表格，以班级为名保存）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">报名截止日期</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">6.地点：树兰楼4022画室</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">四</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）现场书法比赛：根据给出的内容书写（硬笔、软笔都可以）</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.给出的三首诗中自选一首或几首书写；</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.字体不限；</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3.软笔为4尺3开生宣（学校提供），硬笔书法者纸张自带，不超过A3大小，毛笔、印章自带；</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">4.时间90分钟；</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">比赛时间</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12月1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日（周四下午</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3点30-5点）</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5.报名条件：各班派选</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">名学生，可自选硬笔或软笔（报名时注明班级、姓名信息，以备后续班级加分）</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">6.报名形式：学校公共文件夹\音美劳\2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校艺术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">美术</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">\现场书法比赛文件夹（自行下载相关内容报名表格，以班级为名保存）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">报名截止日期</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">8</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">7.地点：树兰楼书法教室</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">五</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一中人物符号</span><span style="font-family:宋体">IP设计</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">比赛：</span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以绍小郡、绍小中为人物形象名称（暂定），设计</span><span style="font-family:宋体">Q版人物形象。可围绕校园活动、师生互动、学习场景等元素进行创作。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1. </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">要求形象设计富有创意，色彩搭配和谐，能体现一中学字积极向上的特色。作品需提交电子稿，文件格式为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">JPG或PNG，分辨率不低于300dpi。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.提交</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">形式：学校公共文件夹</span><span style="font-family:宋体">\音美劳\2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">年校艺术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">美术</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">\</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一中人物符号</span><span style="font-family:宋体">IP形象设计</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">比赛文件夹（以班级</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">姓名</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">为名保存）。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">作品提交时间截止</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12月20日</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">案例分享：</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/11/202511251042430419.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202511251042430419.png" /></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 19px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding: 0;line-height: 27px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 19px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:23px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">六</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">摄影摄像比赛：</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.比赛形式：本次比赛只接受电子稿作品。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.报名条件：一中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">教育集团</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">学生</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3. 作品命名方式为“作品标题+作者姓名+班级”,组图应放于同一文件夹内，对文件夹进行命名并用括号标注组图字样。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">4.投稿作品题材、体裁和风格不限；单幅、组照(1-4幅) 作品均可； JPEG  数码文件规格尺寸每幅作品长边不小于3000 像素，不小于5M, 每位参赛者投稿数量不超过2件；黑白、彩色不限，拍摄器材不限。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">短视频时长在</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1-3分钟内，需配背景音乐、解说文字，分辨率短边不低于1080像素，画幅比例不限，大小不超过300M。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5.交稿形式：学校公共文件夹\音美劳\25年校艺术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">美术</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">\摄影摄像比赛文件夹（自行下载相关内容报名表格，以班级为名保存）</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">6.截止日期：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(192, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2025年12月20日</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">德育处、艺术组</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:right;line-height:27px;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2025年11月25日</span></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align: center;">
